WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.440
<b>Fashion Center Yoshimura</b>

00:01.480 --> 00:03.490
I've finished changing.

00:03.490 --> 00:05.040
I'm done, too.

00:05.040 --> 00:06.440
Me, too.

00:06.750 --> 00:08.270
Okay, come on out.

00:11.330 --> 00:12.950
What do you think?

00:12.950 --> 00:14.950
You look really cute!

00:15.320 --> 00:17.040
Does this work?

00:17.040 --> 00:19.660
I don't really know, either.

00:19.660 --> 00:21.900
You both look good in your outfits!

00:21.900 --> 00:23.070
Right, Satou?

00:23.070 --> 00:24.500
I think they're good?

00:24.500 --> 00:27.690
Huh? Cat-ears? Horns?

00:27.690 --> 00:30.010
You think there's some event going on?

00:30.010 --> 00:33.590
Unfortunately, their heads 
are the biggest problem here.

00:33.900 --> 00:36.470
For now, let's just make sure 
they don't stand out too much.

00:36.830 --> 00:38.030
Hey, look!

00:38.030 --> 00:40.180
I think something like this will look good, too!

00:40.490 --> 00:42.600
All four of us could wear 
different colors of it?

00:43.940 --> 00:45.490
So cute!

00:44.490 --> 00:47.060
<i>Hime's having fun.</i>

02:21.490 --> 02:24.740
Now, what we need to think about is...

02:25.070 --> 02:27.500
what we're going to do from here.

02:27.500 --> 02:28.770
So you say,

02:28.770 --> 02:31.960
but there was nothing at 
the location of the door of light.

02:32.220 --> 02:34.090
It's probably going to be difficult.

02:34.090 --> 02:38.660
I suppose he was known as the Great Sage 
because he could wield magic that powerful.

02:38.660 --> 02:42.020
We could wait for someone
 to come for us from our world,

02:42.020 --> 02:44.810
or we can try and uncover 
another means to return ourselves.

02:45.150 --> 02:48.180
Either way, we currently have no leads.

02:48.610 --> 02:50.200
It's looking hopeless.

02:50.200 --> 02:52.510
And we need to fix that.

02:52.510 --> 02:55.590
Aren't you worried about your nation?

02:56.180 --> 02:57.560
Would you like to order something?

02:57.560 --> 02:58.150
Huh?!

02:58.560 --> 03:02.630
Needakitta's destination is chosen 
by the Merchant Guild.

03:02.630 --> 03:04.740
I'm not worried about my nation.

03:04.740 --> 03:07.280
Oh, Romca...

03:07.280 --> 03:10.000
still has my brother and the Elder, so...

03:10.280 --> 03:14.040
I've been in this world for 
the past ten years anyway.

03:14.420 --> 03:16.420
How can you all be so carefree?

03:16.420 --> 03:19.240
I haven't given up yet.

03:19.240 --> 03:20.980
But now that it's come to this,

03:20.980 --> 03:23.590
we have to consider the worst-case scenario.

03:26.120 --> 03:27.140
Speaking of which,

03:27.570 --> 03:31.510
I'm surprised you can eat 
so much while complaining.

03:32.320 --> 03:34.450
But the food here is good!

03:34.450 --> 03:37.780
I'm a sucker for sweets!

03:37.780 --> 03:40.030
Do we have enough money?

03:40.330 --> 03:43.240
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.220
Huh?

03:45.140 --> 03:47.500
Still, I'm so frustrated.

03:48.350 --> 03:50.830
Even if I know there's nothing 
we can do about it,

03:50.830 --> 03:53.870
I still want to keep searching for a way home.

03:54.580 --> 03:56.610
But how are we supposed to do that?

03:57.260 --> 03:59.390
If there's a spot dense with magic,

03:59.390 --> 04:01.840
then it should be easy 
to connect it to our world.

04:01.840 --> 04:04.410
We'll start by looking for such places!

04:07.230 --> 04:10.680
Even though I got myself super motivated...

04:11.100 --> 04:14.400
we couldn't find any leads.

04:15.590 --> 04:19.260
You know, there are only humans in this land,

04:19.260 --> 04:21.360
not any of the other races.

04:21.620 --> 04:22.330
Okay!

04:22.330 --> 04:24.860
Let's start by bringing more 
cat-people to this land!

04:24.860 --> 04:26.510
Time to make babies!

04:26.510 --> 04:27.660
Stop it!

04:27.660 --> 04:31.370
I'll do my best to conquer this 
ultimate form of outdoors, too.

04:31.700 --> 04:34.000
So you should keep giving it 
your all, too, Saphir-sama!

04:34.650 --> 04:36.850
Now that I think about it, Krystal,

04:36.850 --> 04:40.100
what happened to that talk about advancing 
your relationship with the Ring King

04:40.100 --> 04:41.720
once you came back here?

04:41.720 --> 04:46.210
W-Well, that's up to Satou...

04:46.210 --> 04:47.960
You promised, right?!

04:47.960 --> 04:48.850
Grk!

04:51.240 --> 04:52.810
Okay, good night.

04:53.060 --> 04:54.500
Good night.

04:56.770 --> 04:59.550
It's a bit cramped with four people.

04:59.550 --> 05:01.170
So I'm the one sleeping here.

05:01.170 --> 05:04.410
Will those three be all right by themselves?

05:04.410 --> 05:06.910
They're right next door. They'll be fine.

05:14.530 --> 05:15.370
Hey...

05:15.370 --> 05:16.120
Yes?!

05:16.960 --> 05:20.270
About the money for today's clothes and food...

05:20.270 --> 05:21.850
Oh, that.

05:22.760 --> 05:24.450
In my room...

05:24.930 --> 05:27.510
there was a letter left by Grandpa.

05:28.440 --> 05:31.290
<i>If you're reading this,</i>

05:31.290 --> 05:33.500
<i>then things didn't work out.</i>

05:33.920 --> 05:36.520
<i>I'm sorry I couldn't be by your side.</i>

05:36.520 --> 05:39.980
<i>But I'm glad you're safe, Himeno.</i>

05:40.340 --> 05:42.500
<i>You don't need to worry about a thing.</i>

05:42.500 --> 05:45.110
<i>I've left you a home and money.</i>

05:45.440 --> 05:49.070
<i>I laid all the groundwork 
for you to be able to live here.</i>

05:52.080 --> 05:54.670
<i>I want you to forget about Arnulus,</i>

05:54.670 --> 05:57.710
<i>and live a normal life.</i>

06:01.950 --> 06:03.380
Grandpa...

06:03.910 --> 06:06.510
was planning for if this happened.

06:06.920 --> 06:11.190
So... he said I don't need to 
worry about a thing.

06:17.330 --> 06:20.120
I thought you had moved abroad.

06:20.120 --> 06:23.440
Well, we ran into a bit of trouble.

06:23.440 --> 06:26.540
What were you doing all summer break?

06:26.540 --> 06:28.280
Just some things.

06:29.610 --> 06:34.020
<i>I thought I'd never have to go to school again.</i>

06:36.510 --> 06:38.710
<i>Several days passed after that.</i>

06:39.600 --> 06:44.550
<i>Nefritis began commuting to the library 
to learn more about this world.</i>

06:45.580 --> 06:48.250
<i>Granart apparently made friends 
in the neighborhood.</i>

06:49.080 --> 06:52.190
<i>Saphir has constantly been lost in thought.</i>

07:07.400 --> 07:08.600
Satou.

07:10.680 --> 07:13.610
You've been sneaking out here every night, huh?

07:14.950 --> 07:17.310
I don't mind being back,

07:17.890 --> 07:20.340
but are the princesses okay 
with things being like this?

07:20.790 --> 07:24.260
Do you remember what Grandpa said at the end?

07:24.920 --> 07:29.580
He wanted you to free the princesses 
from the rings' fate.

07:31.410 --> 07:35.880
We all have to find our own 
happiness in this world.

07:36.500 --> 07:37.850
Including you, Satou.

07:40.330 --> 07:42.940
Forget about the other world,

07:42.940 --> 07:47.150
and find happiness with me here.

07:48.230 --> 07:48.930
Please?

07:51.430 --> 07:53.530
Find happiness?

08:00.030 --> 08:01.510
Satou.

08:02.890 --> 08:03.720
Hime.

08:06.770 --> 08:08.000
What?!

08:08.330 --> 08:09.560
The shrine?!

08:15.950 --> 08:17.650
Something's coming from the shrine?

08:17.650 --> 08:18.870
A woman?!

08:23.390 --> 08:27.290
I've waited a long time.

08:28.280 --> 08:30.830
We meet at last,

08:33.370 --> 08:34.820
Ring King.

08:39.010 --> 08:42.060
Oh, am I interrupting?

08:42.060 --> 08:42.970
I'll leave.

08:42.970 --> 08:43.540
Huh?!

08:43.940 --> 08:46.580
Hold on a minute! Did you just say "Ring King"?

08:48.040 --> 08:50.840
You wouldn't happen to be...?

08:57.160 --> 08:59.740
I'm the one protecting the Ring of Earth,

08:59.740 --> 09:01.480
Amber Idanokan.

09:01.970 --> 09:06.100
The Ring Princess... was in this world?!

09:06.700 --> 09:08.600
It started in the distant past.

09:08.940 --> 09:11.930
Once the war with the Abyss King was over,

09:11.930 --> 09:15.390
there were only a handful 
of dwarves who survived.

09:16.270 --> 09:20.820
Eventually the dwarves would die out and 
the Land of Earth, Idanokan, would perish.

09:21.160 --> 09:23.520
The dwarves accepted their pending ruin,

09:23.520 --> 09:25.620
so in order to protect and pass on the ring,

09:26.130 --> 09:29.630
they created a vessel that would 
withstand the test of time—

09:30.070 --> 09:32.090
Amber.

09:32.410 --> 09:34.050
Created?

09:34.650 --> 09:36.970
I'm a manufactured object.

09:37.450 --> 09:39.850
A replica of the dwarf princess.

09:41.800 --> 09:45.980
I was transported to this world 
along with the ring.

09:47.080 --> 09:50.940
In order to prevent anyone 
from stealing the ring.

09:51.730 --> 09:53.960
In order to deliver it to the Ring King.

09:55.420 --> 09:59.220
I've waited for centuries and centuries.

09:59.850 --> 10:01.120
And now...

10:01.950 --> 10:03.640
the Ring King is here.

10:05.660 --> 10:06.620
Now,

10:07.070 --> 10:09.020
let us be bound,

10:09.020 --> 10:10.970
and then we'll defeat the Abyss King,

10:10.970 --> 10:12.750
and bring peace to Arnulus.

10:12.750 --> 10:13.920
No!

10:14.380 --> 10:16.510
Arnulus is already done for.

10:16.510 --> 10:18.590
The Abyss King has returned,

10:18.590 --> 10:20.300
and we fled here!

10:21.160 --> 10:24.810
We've lost. So...!

10:25.140 --> 10:27.740
Satou definitely isn't going back!

10:31.140 --> 10:32.230
Hime...

10:34.500 --> 10:35.650
I see.

10:36.650 --> 10:40.680
So my destiny will go unfulfilled.

10:43.720 --> 10:46.260
Tell me if you have a change of heart.

10:46.790 --> 10:48.860
I'm accustomed to waiting 
for that which never comes.

11:00.300 --> 11:01.970
Hey, Satou.

11:02.300 --> 11:04.530
Will you be coming home early tomorrow?

11:04.530 --> 11:07.020
I'm absolutely bored day after day.

11:07.020 --> 11:10.820
I didn't do any of my summer homework,

11:10.820 --> 11:13.060
so I'll be stuck with 
make-up classes for a while.

11:13.330 --> 11:17.850
You're our husband, so we need you to 
spend more time with us!

11:17.850 --> 11:19.150
R-Right!

11:19.150 --> 11:21.900
Even Nefritis has been feeling bored, too.

11:22.570 --> 11:23.640
What about the library?

11:24.240 --> 11:26.380
Well, you see...

11:26.380 --> 11:30.410
After going there every day, 
they started recognizing me,

11:30.410 --> 11:32.750
and that made it hard to go there anymore...

11:32.750 --> 11:35.390
Saphir's been cooped up in 
the house this whole time too.

11:35.390 --> 11:36.940
Aren't you bored?

11:36.940 --> 11:37.630
Hmm?

11:38.430 --> 11:40.530
Not particularly...

11:44.830 --> 11:46.420
By the way, Ring King.

11:46.420 --> 11:49.520
It looked like you were out late 
with Krystal last night.

11:49.520 --> 11:51.480
What were you two doing?

11:52.830 --> 11:55.400
Speaking of that, actually...

11:55.400 --> 11:57.490
We were just going to 
the convenience store for a bit!

11:57.490 --> 11:58.660
Right, Satou?!

11:58.660 --> 12:00.230
Y-Yeah.

12:07.020 --> 12:08.100
Hime,

12:08.100 --> 12:10.930
are you sure we should 
keep quiet about Amber?

12:11.670 --> 12:13.880
What can we do if we go back?

12:13.880 --> 12:17.960
Can you really defeat the Abyss King 
if we collect all five rings?

12:18.470 --> 12:21.050
Can you really defeat 
something like that, Satou?

12:24.690 --> 12:29.550
We need to find happiness in this world now.

12:34.370 --> 12:36.620
Sorry I was late leaving!

12:36.620 --> 12:37.560
It's fine.

12:39.460 --> 12:41.180
Whoa, let's hurry!

12:47.160 --> 12:49.450
Amber? What are you doing?

12:49.810 --> 12:52.450
I'm doing what I should be doing.

12:52.450 --> 12:53.270
Huh?

12:54.750 --> 12:57.790
It's my duty to watch over the Ring King.

12:58.290 --> 13:03.010
And it's my destiny 
for the Ring King to find me.

13:03.420 --> 13:07.030
Yesterday, I heard the voice 
of someone searching for me.

13:07.030 --> 13:08.970
I thought you had finally come.

13:09.820 --> 13:10.720
But...

13:10.720 --> 13:13.940
You weren't searching for me.

13:15.250 --> 13:21.150
You were searching for the happiness 
the Maiden of the Ring of Light spoke of.

13:25.250 --> 13:28.820
Come on, come on over, they're cheap!

13:29.230 --> 13:31.950
They even have carrots.

13:31.950 --> 13:32.830
Apples.

13:33.700 --> 13:34.680
Amber?

13:35.090 --> 13:37.120
The apples here are exquisite.

13:37.470 --> 13:39.220
The people working this shop

13:39.220 --> 13:42.040
are the family that have protected 
the mountain shrine for generations.

13:42.470 --> 13:45.590
Their offerings were always exquisite apples.

13:45.940 --> 13:49.340
Wow. I never knew that.

13:49.340 --> 13:52.560
<b>Exquisite Apples
178 yen apiece</b>

13:50.510 --> 13:52.040
Apples, huh?

13:54.670 --> 13:55.550
Huh?

14:12.300 --> 14:15.870
I can return you to Arnulus.

14:16.180 --> 14:18.760
I was granted the power to do that.

14:20.470 --> 14:22.670
Once we forge the contract of the rings,

14:22.670 --> 14:24.970
I will regain my power,

14:24.970 --> 14:27.970
and I can open a door to Arnulus.

14:34.150 --> 14:36.730
It's finally over!

14:48.530 --> 14:50.260
Where's the Maiden of the Ring of Light?

14:50.920 --> 14:53.220
She finished her homework early and went home.

14:53.700 --> 14:55.550
Said she had the housework.

14:56.260 --> 15:00.420
Ring King, did you intend to return 
to Arnulus as soon as possible?

15:01.230 --> 15:02.750
That was my intention.

15:03.510 --> 15:06.380
But after seeing the look on Hime's face...

15:07.460 --> 15:10.910
She might be right that we 
won't be able to do anything,

15:11.340 --> 15:13.150
even now that we've gathered all the rings.

15:13.800 --> 15:14.860
Don't worry.

15:16.170 --> 15:18.090
The power of the rings is absolute.

15:18.590 --> 15:21.730
You'll definitely be capable 
of sealing the Abyss King.

15:22.250 --> 15:24.430
That's what I've been taught.

15:25.340 --> 15:27.960
Just like the legends claim, huh?

15:28.610 --> 15:30.010
I won't force you.

15:30.730 --> 15:33.610
The Ring King is the reason I was created,

15:34.330 --> 15:36.570
so I'll watch over you until you die.

15:37.030 --> 15:39.200
"'Til death do us part," huh?

15:39.540 --> 15:43.420
I want to know the reason I was created.

15:44.040 --> 15:46.860
I want to learn the value 
of the time I spent waiting.

15:47.420 --> 15:48.850
That's heavy.

15:48.850 --> 15:50.870
I'm not heavy.

15:50.870 --> 15:53.170
I was created to weigh 
approximately the same as a person.

15:53.170 --> 15:53.970
Huh?

15:54.600 --> 15:56.180
That was a joke.

15:58.550 --> 16:00.680
The Ring Princesses are all the same.

16:01.250 --> 16:05.470
We live our lives for the Ring King 
and dedicate ourselves to the world.

16:05.470 --> 16:07.060
That's the reason we were born.

16:07.970 --> 16:10.030
And that duty is never a light one.

16:10.970 --> 16:12.660
Their reason for living?

16:14.230 --> 16:16.310
<i>That's... right.</i>

16:20.070 --> 16:22.040
Would you give me your ring?

16:23.310 --> 16:25.000
Have you changed your mind?

16:25.380 --> 16:27.720
No, I found my answer.

16:28.590 --> 16:30.340
I'll do what I need to do.

16:32.110 --> 16:32.940
I see.

16:35.640 --> 16:36.740
I'm happy.

16:38.270 --> 16:40.220
You won't ask me why?

16:40.660 --> 16:43.690
Your will is my will.

16:44.190 --> 16:45.730
I need no reason.

16:46.500 --> 16:47.330
I see.

17:11.420 --> 17:12.430
Hime?

17:20.540 --> 17:22.870
I'm sorry for startling you.

17:23.750 --> 17:26.360
I was remembering Grandpa again.

17:27.510 --> 17:29.230
But I'm okay.

17:29.230 --> 17:31.700
The tears are just coming 
on their own right now.

17:32.350 --> 17:35.610
I'm sure... I'll get used to it eventually.

17:37.800 --> 17:39.460
That ring...

17:40.570 --> 17:41.870
It's the Ring of Earth.

17:42.390 --> 17:44.450
Now I've gathered all five rings.

17:44.450 --> 17:48.080
You accepted the ring from Amber? Why?

17:48.900 --> 17:50.210
We're returning to Arnulus.

17:51.900 --> 17:53.920
No! You can't!

17:54.430 --> 17:58.870
We're all here right now because 
we couldn't collect all five rings.

17:59.750 --> 18:02.640
If we have all the rings, then we have to go.

18:02.640 --> 18:04.160
I know that!

18:04.160 --> 18:07.070
But we were finally able to be together again!

18:07.630 --> 18:11.810
If I were to lose you 
in that dangerous world...

18:12.410 --> 18:16.440
Is that all the duty of the ring 
meant to you, Hime?

18:18.490 --> 18:20.290
You were my childhood friend 
for ten whole years.

18:20.290 --> 18:22.500
Those ten years were everything 
I ever knew about you, Hime.

18:23.140 --> 18:29.050
Yet the duty of the ring was so important 
to you that you threw away that decade, right?

18:29.660 --> 18:32.780
Your Grandpa asked me to free you 
from the duty of the rings,

18:33.610 --> 18:36.670
but that doesn't mean running away 
from it or forgetting about it.

18:37.410 --> 18:39.770
It means truly ending things for good.

18:42.250 --> 18:44.710
Let's face this together, Hime.

18:45.620 --> 18:47.990
This time, I'll be with you.

18:49.500 --> 18:53.240
This duty is no longer yours to bear alone.

18:54.500 --> 18:55.800
Your grandpa said it, too.

18:56.430 --> 18:59.210
The power of the rings 
is the power of our bonds.

19:00.490 --> 19:04.280
I love you more than anyone else 
in both worlds, Hime.

19:05.210 --> 19:06.070
We'll be all right.

19:06.660 --> 19:08.040
We won't lose.

19:13.300 --> 19:15.570
What is this? You sound like a fool.

19:16.520 --> 19:18.100
But I'm relieved.

19:18.620 --> 19:21.620
I can't see you losing when you're like that.

19:22.440 --> 19:23.430
Hime...

19:24.590 --> 19:25.750
Then...

19:25.750 --> 19:29.480
I should respond to your love, as well, Satou.

19:31.380 --> 19:32.770
Hey, Satou?

19:33.470 --> 19:37.150
Shall we fulfill our promise now?

19:37.400 --> 19:40.110
Huh? You mean...?

19:40.600 --> 19:42.410
Don't make me say it.

19:46.250 --> 19:47.570
This is like a dream.

19:48.790 --> 19:52.550
Doing this in your room.

19:55.990 --> 19:56.920
Hime...

20:06.180 --> 20:10.070
I feel like I'm stealing a lead.

20:11.480 --> 20:14.510
Makes me feel kind of guilty about the others.

20:16.520 --> 20:19.510
I told you you're the only one for me, right?

20:20.730 --> 20:21.460
Yeah.

20:28.330 --> 20:31.460
I finished preparing the teleportation spell.

20:31.460 --> 20:32.960
Now we can return to Arnulus—

20:32.960 --> 20:33.580
Ah.

20:35.790 --> 20:37.880
Worst timing possible?

20:38.250 --> 20:40.090
Mhmm. Mhmm!

20:40.370 --> 20:43.620
But I can only use 
the teleportation spell once.

20:44.010 --> 20:44.900
What do we do?

20:44.900 --> 20:47.010
We're coming! We'll use it right away!

20:47.400 --> 20:49.220
You good with that, Hime?!

20:49.560 --> 20:51.350
Y-Yeah!

20:53.180 --> 20:54.520
What's the matter, Satou?!

20:57.020 --> 20:59.690
It's not—! No, it is what you think, but...!

21:01.210 --> 21:03.610
It seems the time has arrived.

21:03.610 --> 21:05.450
You noticed?

21:05.820 --> 21:09.330
You shouldn't underestimate 
the insight of cat people.

21:09.960 --> 21:13.290
Granart, um, I'm sorry.

21:13.290 --> 21:16.340
No, I understand 
what you were thinking, Krystal.

21:16.730 --> 21:21.690
We have absolutely no idea 
what's happening in our world right now.

21:21.690 --> 21:24.800
So I figured I would respect Satou's wishes.

21:25.110 --> 21:28.030
Though I was hoping it would go this way.

21:28.030 --> 21:29.560
Hold on a minute.

21:29.560 --> 21:31.720
I don't understand what's going on.

21:32.040 --> 21:34.680
We don't really have time 
to go into detail right now...

21:35.970 --> 21:38.310
What? So this woman is...

21:38.310 --> 21:42.620
Amber Idanokan, Princess of the Ring of Earth?

21:43.350 --> 21:45.640
We can go home?!

21:45.640 --> 21:46.400
Yeah.

21:46.690 --> 21:49.120
We can return to Arnulus.

